  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the eggs and liquid cheese.",
    "Add the chopped spinach, feta cheese, salt, and pepper to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Arrange the toasted bread slices in a baking dish.",
    "Pour the egg mixture over the bread slices.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the top of the bake.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until the eggs are set.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
